WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.600 --> 00:00:02.965
MyCampusView Academy.

2
00:00:03.015 --> 00:00:06.530
AI for Young Builders, video 1.

3
00:00:06.580 --> 00:00:09.980
Welcome: AI is all around you.

4
00:00:11.150 --> 00:00:13.548
Welcome to AI for Young Builders!

5
00:00:13.598 --> 00:00:17.701
In this course you will build your very own AI, one that

6
00:00:17.751 --> 00:00:22.597
learns to recognise drawings and things you show it, right in your

7
00:00:22.647 --> 00:00:23.190
browser.

8
00:00:24.550 --> 00:00:28.495
You probably used AI today without noticing.

9
00:00:28.545 --> 00:00:32.308
Your phone unlocks when it sees your face.

10
00:00:32.358 --> 00:00:34.851
A maps app predicts traffic.

11
00:00:34.901 --> 00:00:38.028
An app translates Hindi into Tamil.

12
00:00:38.078 --> 00:00:41.660
A video app suggests what to watch next.

13
00:00:41.710 --> 00:00:46.200
Every one of these learned patterns from examples.

14
00:00:47.550 --> 00:00:48.725
So what is AI?

15
00:00:48.775 --> 00:00:56.947
Artificial intelligence means a computer doing something we usually think needs a human brain.

16
00:00:56.997 --> 00:01:01.495
Most AI does this by learning from lots of examples.

17
00:01:01.545 --> 00:01:04.731
It is not magic, and it is not alive.

18
00:01:04.781 --> 00:01:08.230
It is a pattern-finder, built by people.

19
00:01:09.550 --> 00:01:11.604
AI is busy in India too.

20
00:01:11.654 --> 00:01:17.128
Banks use it to spot suspicious UPI payments in a split second.

21
00:01:17.178 --> 00:01:23.879
Bhashini, a Government of India project, translates between Indian languages.

22
00:01:23.929 --> 00:01:29.140
And farmers can photograph a leaf to check for crop disease.

23
00:01:30.450 --> 00:01:32.306
Here is your journey.

24
00:01:32.356 --> 00:01:36.027
You will train your own image classifier.

25
00:01:36.077 --> 00:01:39.476
You will test it and fix its mistakes.

26
00:01:39.526 --> 00:01:43.379
You will talk to a real AI chatbot, safely.

27
00:01:43.429 --> 00:01:48.280
And you will learn how to make AI fairer for everyone.

28
00:01:49.650 --> 00:01:53.291
Before we start, five Safe AI rules.

29
00:01:53.341 --> 00:01:56.368
Keep personal details private.

30
00:01:56.418 --> 00:02:02.110
Remember that AI can be wrong, so check important facts.

31
00:02:02.160 --> 00:02:02.930
Be kind.

32
00:02:02.980 --> 00:02:05.596
Be honest when you use AI.

33
00:02:05.646 --> 00:02:09.800
And ask an adult if anything worries you.

34
00:02:11.300 --> 00:02:12.569
Let us recap.

35
00:02:12.619 --> 00:02:18.857
AI is a computer doing tasks that usually need human thinking.

36
00:02:18.907 --> 00:02:22.711
Most AI learns patterns from examples.

37
00:02:22.761 --> 00:02:29.406
AI can be wrong, so keep personal details private and check facts.

38
00:02:29.456 --> 00:02:31.840
Next: Rules or learning?

39
00:02:31.890 --> 00:02:33.260
How AI learns.
